      "value": "Also possibly related to the fix listed for vrchat 2019.1.1p1:\n\"- Fixed an issue where if your avatar could not load for various reasons, you were stuck and unable to move unless you entered Safe Mode or used the Ctrl-\\ Default Avatar shortcut\"\n\nIn this case the actual issue may be if a network request or loading request never finishes for any reason the player may be unable to move at all.",
